/Pg 9 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
6156 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (All client-server interactions are secured using token-based authentication, TLS encryption, and role-based access control. Events such as account changes or transactions trigger background validations and audit logs to ensure compliance with GDPR and POPIA.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
6157 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Usability)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
6158 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The client delivers an intuitive, accessible UI using real-time event streams \(e.g., WebSocket\) for dynamic feedback like XP gains or goal updates. Interfaces follow Material Design and Apple HIG, with AR and gamified features built for smooth, engaging interactions.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
